# ── All deploy artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Photos (834 MB), logos, and generated HTML — all served via Cloudflare Pages.
# Deploy separately with: npx wrangler pages deploy deploy/ --project-name=pct-geoguesser
deploy/

